-- Scene 2: ONE goal, handed over, then MONITORED to its end --
  [OK] a fresh conversation carries no goal
  [OK] asking with NO goal REFUSES (the loop is goal-driven)
  [OK] a goal handed over -> the session is pursuing it
  [OK] a conversation has exactly ONE goal (a second is refused)
  [OK] the goal is MONITORED -- fulfilled the moment no gap remains
  [OK] ... the verdict travels with the reply
  [OK] ... and it says WHY it is fulfilled
  [OK] REVOKED is the other way out
  [OK] ... on the record, with its reason
